!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 45474
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: Liver
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = No treatment
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Wild caught
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Tissues were extracted from recently (<12hr) deceased or euthanized animals and flash frozen in liquid nitrogen. Animals not euthanized in lab were kept at 4°C and processed within 12hr of death. Frozen tissues were pulverized using a Cell Crusher piston chilled with liquid nitrogen to produce uniform powdered tissue. Approximately 30mg of frozen tissue powder was used for Trizol RNA extraction. Contaminating DNA was removed from RNA samples using Purelink DNase kit along with Purelink RNA columns. Purified RNA quality was checked using agarose gel examination for rRNA integrity and Qubit analysis
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = For RNAseq, the RNA samples were processed with the Illumina TruSeq stranded total RNA RiboZero Gold kit and then subjected to Illumina HiSeq 4000 paired-end 150bp sequencing; For MeDIP, genomic DNA samples were processed using the NEBNext UltraII DNA Library Prep kit.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Ribo-depletion for RNAseq
!Sample_data_processing = raw fastq reads files were cleaned by Trimmomatic-0.36
!Sample_data_processing = gene expression (reads counts) were calculated by salmon 1.4.0
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: gene expression
